WEBVTT

00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:06.931
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:08.156 --> 00:00:11.515
<v><b>M:</b></v> We proceeded cautiously along the narrow rocky path.

00:00:13.429 --> 00:00:14.158
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:15.209 --> 00:00:18.745
<v><b>F:</b></v> They were enormously proud of her when she got a place at Harvard.

00:00:20.727 --> 00:00:21.506
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:22.583 --> 00:00:26.203
<v><b>M:</b></v> Obviously, I’m disappointed that I wasn’t chosen for the team.

00:00:28.190 --> 00:00:28.956
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:30.003 --> 00:00:33.747
<v><b>F:</b></v> Life was harder then because neither of us had a job.

00:00:35.951 --> 00:00:36.813
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:37.883 --> 00:00:40.399
<v><b>M:</b></v> I asked for the bill, but he’d already paid.

00:00:42.299 --> 00:00:43.103
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:44.287 --> 00:00:47.343
<v><b>F:</b></v> Apparently, our local supermarket’s closing down.

00:00:49.201 --> 00:00:50.062
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 7

00:00:51.210 --> 00:00:54.235
<v><b>F:</b></v> It was blowing a gale, so we couldn’t go outside.

00:00:56.102 --> 00:00:56.824
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 8

00:00:57.921 --> 00:01:01.083
<v><b>M:</b></v> He opened the email eagerly to see if he’d got the job.

00:01:02.998 --> 00:01:03.847
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 9

00:01:04.843 --> 00:01:08.671
<v><b>M:</b></v> A red flag denotes that it’s extremely dangerous to swim.

00:01:10.637 --> 00:01:11.399
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 10

00:01:12.476 --> 00:01:16.306
<v><b>F:</b></v> We’re never eating there again – the food was shocking!